cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper below."
title: "Analysis code for: Tissue-level and cell-intrinsic inflammatory signals diverge with SLC7A7 expression in glioma-associated microglia"
abstract: >-
  Scripts for a four-layer analysis of SLC7A7 in glioma-associated myeloid
  cells: bulk survival across four cohorts, donor-level single-cell analysis of
  the GBmap atlas, tumor-level spatial transcriptomics, and a BV2 overexpression
  experiment.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/vegesion/SLC7A7_glioma_microglia"
keywords:
  - glioma
  - tumor-associated myeloid cells
  - SLC7A7
  - amino acid transport
  - single-cell RNA sequencing
  - spatial transcriptomics
